WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.660
The Argama secretly continued
replenishing...

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:37.700
...while docked in the "Neutral Side".

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:42.370
At the colony, Kamille met
Rosamia Badam.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:49.810
Nobody knew what significance
this encounter would have on Kamille.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:55.120
Activation of Gryps

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.230
Space colonies...

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:07.020
...man-made <i>terra firma</i>, created
for humanity to live in space.

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:10.600
The agricultural blocks in the foreground...

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:13.070
...each control the amount
of sunlight absorbed...

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:16.940
...thereby cultivating the needed amount
of agricultural products year round.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:31.510
- Haro's mine!
- Come on, it's mine!

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:32.320
No, it's mine!

00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:33.510
Stop!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.560
Haro!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.550
- Kamille.
- Yeah.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:37.420
- Let go!
- Gimme!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.460
- Got it!
- That's not fair, Rosammy!

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.500
You can't! It's mine.

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.900
- Something's not right about her.
- Yes, I know.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:48.000
- She won't give Haro back to me!
- Kamille!

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:49.800
Kamille!

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.600
- What?!
- H-Hey!

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:53.870
You're teasing me again, Brother.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.910
You promised you'd be right back.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:58.310
Let me introduce you to Lieutenant Emma.

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:12.090
<i>What is this sensation?</i>

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:14.160
<i>Who in the world is this girl?</i>

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:16.860
There's no need to worry.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:18.830
Miss Emma is very kind.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:24.970
No way!

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:26.800
This person is...

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.280
...frightening!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:29.650
Rosammy!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:32.170
Th-This person...

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.350
No!

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.140
Don't touch me!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.190
<i>What's she so afraid of?</i>

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:42.190
Let her rest in the detention room.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:43.680
Right.

00:03:44.260 --> 00:03:46.990
I'll talk to her once she's had a chance
to calm down.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.030
Yes.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.060
Fa, take her to the detention room.

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:54.100
Huh?

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:57.870
Do as Fa tells you to, okay?

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.740
Kamille!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.010
I think that lady's going to run off
with my brother!

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.550
No way!

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:07.880
She will!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.440
Sorry, I'm late.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.850
Thanks for coming.

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:13.620
What is the extent of the debris
in the area around Gryps?

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:16.680
Some metal and rocks
thrown out during construction.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.090
Nothing too significant.

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:21.190
If they had rebuilt Gryps 2
into a laser emitter...

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:23.100
...I'd think there'd be more rocks...!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:24.460
They're trying to move Gryps 2...

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.530
...from the Gate of Zedan to where
they have a direct shot at the Moon.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.740
Where the debris they threw out
will naturally disperse.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.230
Did they really rebuild the colony
into a laser emitter?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:36.500
It's our job to find that out.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:39.750
We must also find out about Gryps 1
and the Gate of Zedan.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.910
What is it?

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.730
You shouldn't be here, Rosammy!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.420
Why isn't she in the detention room?

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:53.260
I'm sorry.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.200
Don't scold Fa!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.700
It's my fault.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.500
I'm still not used to this place.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:00.330
Come on, let's go.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.270
Is that the civilian
who boarded at Colony 13?

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:05.840
Yes, sir!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:09.770
I want Dr. Hasan to conduct
a thorough physical examination of her.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.240
Would that be okay, Kamille?

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:12.940
S-Sure.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:17.950
But do you really think Rosammy
is a Cyber-Newtype...

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.990
...like Lieutenant Quattro suggests?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.820
No, I never said anything
of the sort, Kamille.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.920
D-Didn't he?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.050
No, he didn't.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.370
Rosammy?! What's wrong?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:37.060
<i>My head hurts.</i>

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.230
Please!

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:39.000
Huh? What?

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:41.940
Please tell me more about
my brother, and about yourself?

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.810
Please tell me anything!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:45.580
Sure.

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.480
But what's bothering you?

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.050
I'm afraid to be alone.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.140
That's all.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:16.940
You've come because you needed a place
to rest your soul, am I right?

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:19.510
Rest my soul?

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.510
Your heart was hurting...

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.850
...but none of the men on the Argama
were sensitive enough to realize that.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:32.020
You had no choice but to
play the role of a strong woman.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.500
But you grew exhausted.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:36.990
You needed a place to rest.

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.020
You talk as if you've been
watching me all along.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.510
This warmth...

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.050
...is what you've been seeking.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:57.720
If my feelings turn out
to be insincere...

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.750
...you can stab me through my heart.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.750
Paptimus Scirocco.

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.890
If that happens, I will not resist.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:12.090
I will return to the Jupitris
with the Palace Athene.

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:13.730
I'll leave the Messala with you.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.190
Use it as you wish.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.530
Thank you very much.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:23.410
<i>There is no unusual enemy movement</i>
<i>in the area of Gryps 2!</i>

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.410
<i>Rick Dias, you can go!</i>

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.720
Rick Dias, taking off!

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.550
Gundam Mk. II. Emma, taking off!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.600
Zeta Gundam. Kamille, let's do it!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.530
Mobile suits?!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:54.300
We'll send out our Barzam team!

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:55.340
Okay!

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.310
Mobile suits!

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.880
The girl that Scirocco brought
is still here, isn't she?

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:02.780
Do you mean Ensign Reccoa?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:04.610
Send her out to search
for enemies as well!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:05.780
But, she's...!

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.020
- I'm ordering you to send her out!
- Yes sir!

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:09.220
Get Ensign Reccoa!

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:14.890
<i>I may be able to find out Scirocco's</i>
<i>true intentions by watching her actions.</i>

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.310
<i>Ensign Reccoa, you're to sortie under</i>
<i>Lieutenant Hamil's command!</i>

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:33.350
Roger!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.220
Kamille.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.450
You're going too fast, it looks unnatural.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.250
Right!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.450
<i>Our objective is not to fight!</i>

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.650
I know that!

00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:48.990
I see the silhouette of mobile suits!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:50.120
Watch out!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.270
- I'm switching off the wireless.
- <i>Roger!</i>

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:04.850
Zeta!

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.170
<i>Ensign Reccoa, did you find something?</i>

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.640
N-No, sir.

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:14.950
Even a Rick Dias.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.060
<i>Ensign Reccoa, what's the matter?!</i>

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.490
<i>Why am I hesitating?</i>

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:26.190
<i>I can no longer return to the A.E.U.G.!</i>

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.100
Lieutenant Hamil!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.730
Mobile suits detected, bottom right!

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:32.770
<i>What?!</i>

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.710
They found us!

00:09:47.490 --> 00:09:48.960
That machine...!

00:09:53.930 --> 00:09:55.060
Is it Sarah?!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.430
Kamille! Our mission takes top priority!
Hurry!

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:05.970
Yes, I know!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.720
<i>Kamille! Move ahead!</i>

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.250
Roger!

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.590
Lieutenant Hamil!

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:34.270
I won't let you go after the Zeta!

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.030
Let go of me, Lieutenant Emma!

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.770
What's wrong, Lieutenant?

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:46.710
That voice. Could it be...? It can't be...!

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.480
Draw the enemy's attention to us...

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:54.650
...so that we can send the Zeta
into the airspace of Gryps.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.120
Lieutenant, proceed to the deck!

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:58.560
Have backup mobile suits
ready to launch!

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.350
<i>Second wave going out!</i>

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:02.450
Launching crew, go upstairs!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:07.470
I must fight as well.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.470
What are you doing here?!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:12.970
A battle's about to begin!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.980
You'd better get into a normal suit.

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.770
Aren't you feeling well?

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.310
Rosammy.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.480
My brother's out there.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:22.640
Rosammy.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:24.320
Don't worry!

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:26.450
I'll protect you.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.650
<i>I want to fight!</i>

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:32.080
<i>Somebody, get me a mobile suit.</i>

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.860
Sarah, how long do you intend on...?!

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:47.470
What tremendous skill, Zeta!

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:58.920
K-Kamille!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:11:59.720
What?!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.540
Hey! Wait!

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.300
Who are you, piloting the Messala?!

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.910
It's not retaliating.
Was I imagining it?

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.100
What?!

00:12:44.170 --> 00:12:45.720
What's this nostalgic feeling?!

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.740
That pilot.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:12:59.310
Is it Miss Reccoa?!

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.810
I'm glad to see you alive, Miss Reccoa!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.190
Kamille.

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:08.720
Long time no see.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:10.990
Truly.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:13.600
Y-You're on a mission, right?

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:17.030
You infiltrated the Titans
to search out their secrets, right?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.260
You're very kind.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.100
But you're wrong.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:23.700
I made the decision to ally with the Titans.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:25.930
It's true.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:28.770
I made the move on my own
to become a pilot for the Titans.

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.140
That can't be!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:32.540
I've heard of a method whereby you
deceive your allies...

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:34.410
...to better carry out the duty of spying.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:35.720
Kamille.

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.110
Please.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:38.780
That's very selfish of you!

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:40.450
Hate me, if you wish!

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:44.290
While fighting you, I just wanted
to prove myself to them!

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.120
- I won't take this!
- Kamille!

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:47.430
Why?!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.790
Why must we meet like this
while we're still alive?!

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:54.160
Once we're enemies, we must
go after each other's lives!

00:13:54.240 --> 00:13:55.290
Kamille.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.800
Don't make things difficult for me.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.500
There's nothing for me on the Argama.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:03.850
I may not be good enough for you...

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.470
...but at least I can protect you!

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:07.910
Is that not enough?!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.720
Y-You're so kind...

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:13.880
...it's almost cruel.

00:14:15.890 --> 00:14:18.420
But someday you'll understand
my change of...!

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:20.830
I'll never understand such nonsense!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.650
Unless you do...

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:26.060
...you'll end up being taken over
and killed by your own sincerity.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:27.870
Killed by my sincerity?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:43.940
Open it, Miss Reccoa!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:49.190
The Gryps 2 Colony Laser
has been completed!

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.130
Have the Argama retreat!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.490
Please! Open up!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.500
<i>Out of my way, Kamille!</i>

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:02.860
You mustn't go!

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.570
You must return! It's still not too late!

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:08.800
Miss Reccoa.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.880
<i>Reccoa!!</i>

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.230
Kamille.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:28.520
- You met Ensign Reccoa, didn't you?
- I don't know!

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:30.620
- Reccoa?
- Brother!

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:32.870
Where are you going?!

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:35.200
What do you care where I go?!

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:39.060
You haven't given a report yet and
you've completely lost your cool!

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:41.700
It's natural for a child
like me to lose my cool...

00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:43.570
...when told something
I can't understand!

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.940
What are you doing to my brother?!

00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:48.920
This is not the time for you
to get involved!

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:49.850
Brother.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.290
Rosammy.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.120
Please go play with the children.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.720
You should've killed her!

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:06.970
Lieutenant Emma!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.000
Captain!

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:10.740
You betrayed the Titans
by coming here!

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:12.670
It's a different situation in my case!

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.410
Is everything justified when acting
in accordance with your ideology?!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.900
Don't talk like a brat!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:22.470
If all one has to do is live on
emotions alone, that's easy!

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:25.010
Then how come you have to keep
slapping people?!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:26.950
Kamille, stop it!

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:28.360
You too, Lieutenant Emma!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:30.490
I'm inclined to believe the information...

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:33.550
...that the Gryps 2 Colony Laser
is completed, Captain.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:36.620
Lieutenant?! I find such information
to lack credibility.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.790
No, I'd also like to believe it.

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:41.690
Otherwise, we're left completely
wretched.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.970
We'll keep this incident to ourselves.

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:46.970
I'm sure you understand why.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.770
The adult way of doing things again!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.470
It's dishonest! What good
will hiding it do anyway?!

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:53.520
Kamille!

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:55.370
I knew it!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:58.440
Just act like an adult, right?
I'll pretend to know everything!

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:00.290
What are you going to do?

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.520
According to them,
I never even met Reccoa.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:03.790
What do you mean?

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:06.050
I'm to forget about anything
they find inconvenient.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:08.090
Does everyone agree on it?

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:08.960
Yeah.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:12.900
What is it?

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:15.100
You're the only one
who has the face of a child.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:16.430
Are you making fun of me?

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:18.230
No way. It's a compliment.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:19.540
Brother!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.310
What's wrong?

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:23.080
Dr. Hasan.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.140
Kamille, you tell her for me.

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:28.150
There's nothing to be afraid of,
and it'll be over right away.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.780
No, there's nothing wrong with me!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.710
These are Captain's orders.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.810
I'm to give her a physical examination.

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:37.450
They say there's a chance
she could be a Cyber-Newtype.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:40.890
What are you saying...?
Rosammy is a Cyber-Newtype?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:42.700
It hasn't been determined.

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:45.000
But the Argama crew is quite anxious
about the possibility.

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.160
In any case, we'll conduct
a thorough examination, and...!

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:49.730
Isn't that girl, Rosammy, a spy?

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.010
I don't believe so, but...

00:17:52.070 --> 00:17:54.740
...any personal relationships
that make people suspicious...

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:57.900
- ...can end up affecting the crew's morale.
- You're right.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:03.820
Lieutenant, I know you have the burden
of being a former Titans member, but...!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:05.720
Please don't say another word.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.760
I'm sorry about the incident with Kamille.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.580
I understand you made contact
with the Argama's mobile suits.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:38.950
Yes, sir.

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.350
Good to hear.

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:42.690
The unidentified vessel has been confirmed.
It's the Argama!

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:47.490
There are no other vessels
detected in the area!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.250
Do they intend to attack Gryps 2?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.660
What's the status on the Colony Laser?!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.440
We've begun preparations
for a partial trial.

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:58.200
What's the firing angle?

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.900
Side 2 airspace is
within its target range.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.500
- Can we target the Argama?
- Yes, sir!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:05.840
Okay, fire the Colony Laser.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:07.850
Make sure Colony 13
is outside of the target range.

00:19:08.320 --> 00:19:09.780
Of course!

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.180
It is the perfect threat to the A.E.U.G..

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.520
Captain, please excuse me.

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:15.420
You may not go!

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:17.360
Remain here until I say so!

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:18.390
Yes, sir.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:20.990
You must get used to the Titans!

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:23.030
Three minutes to fire!

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:44.650
Has there been any movement
at Gryps 2?

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:45.720
No, sir.

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:48.280
- I'm going to the deck.
- What is it?

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:50.150
Doesn't it seem <i>too</i> quiet?

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:53.190
Yeah. There's so much debris,
we won't even need dummies.

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:55.860
I'm sure Reccoa's information is credible.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:57.960
Very possibly there'll be...!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:04.570
I see. If the Colony Laser's a reality, then it
could be targeting Side 2 or the Moon...!

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:07.600
All units! Take level one battle stations!

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:11.500
<i>There's a possibility that Gryps 2
<i>will be using their Colony Laser!</i></i>

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:13.040
We're not going to make it!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:22.150
No! I hate doctors!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:25.320
That's not it! We've got to take
level one battle stations!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:28.090
We have to go to the living quarters
and stay there!

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.460
But I'm afraid of this doctor!

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:32.730
Okay, okay. It's okay if I disappear, right?

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.690
Forty percent critical limit!

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:37.170
Fire in three, two, one!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:38.510
Okay.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.570
Damn Titans!

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:06.870
What?!

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:08.100
What's this light?!

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.900
People are dying?

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.230
Where?

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:19.910
What is this? This feeling.

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.540
It's like a mix of sorrow and pain.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.480
It's Colony 18 of Side 2.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.750
One mirror has been partially destroyed.

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:28.880
It's a direct hit.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:32.050
It would've left two huge holes
of about 200 meters across each.

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:33.750
Will the colony collapse?

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.460
It shouldn't collapse, but...!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:39.290
How could those bastards
think of doing something so heinous?!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:44.070
Stop the mobile suits from taking off!

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.870
We're leaving this area at full speed!

00:21:47.810 --> 00:21:49.780
Congratulations, Captain Bask.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.350
Just imagine this at 100 percent output.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.240
Exactly!

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:56.340
Now, the guys from the Neutral Colonies
and the Moon will realize...

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:59.650
...how pointless it is to oppose
the Titans.

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.690
The Argama's retreating.

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:16.960
But I can no longer return there.

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:24.480
It's impossible to stop that thing...

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:28.310
...with the strength
of just one human being.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:50.120
On the day Reccoa leads
a gas attack unit...

00:23:50.230 --> 00:23:52.060
...Rosamia flees from the Argama.

00:23:52.800 --> 00:23:56.900
This is the moment Rosamia
awakes as a Cyber-Newtype...

00:23:57.870 --> 00:24:01.900
...and realizes that the Zeta,
piloted by Kamille, is in fact her enemy.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:07.070
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"Awakening".

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Awakening

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:09.720
You will see the tears of time.
